SUMMARY:Winter Solstice Sound Bath
DESCRIPTION:Join the Sonoma County Sober Girl Gang for a special Winter Solstice Sound Bath! Celebrate the season with an evening of relaxation\, reflection\, and community. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Monday\, December 21\, 2026\nTime: 6:30 PM\nLocation: Sebastopol Community Center\nAddress: 390 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA 95472\nCost: $30 per person\n\nReserved VIP seating will be available for our group. Children ages 11 and up are welcome! \nWhat’s Included?\nThe evening includes a cacao ceremony\, featuring a warm\, alcohol-free chocolate drink made with nut milk\, chocolate\, and honey. \nFinancial Assistance & Sponsorship\nWe want everyone who wishes to participate to feel welcome\, regardless of financial circumstances. \nIf cost is a barrier: Please reach out privately to Jenelle or someone in the Girl Gang. We would love to have you join us! \nIn a season of abundance: If you would like to sponsor a ticket for someone who might otherwise be unable to attend\, please let Jenelle know. \nQuestions & Payment\nFor questions\, payment arrangements\, or sponsorship information\, please refer to the event flyer for contact details and Venmo payment instructions. \nWe hope you’ll join us for a peaceful evening of connection and celebration as we welcome the winter solstice together!
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/winter-solstice-sound-bath/
LOCATION:Sebastopol Community Center\, 390 Morris St\, Sebastopol\, CA\, 95472\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/B4D00157-025A-46C0-9960-9A360C8107A5.png
END:VEVENT
