UID:9023-1800104400-1800115200@sonomacountyaa.org
SUMMARY:Seminar - A New Beginning
DESCRIPTION:AA Seminar: Making a New Beginning in Sobriety with AA\nJoin the Sonoma County Intergroup Fellowship for an afternoon of fellowship\, food\, and recovery at our upcoming AA Seminar\, “Making a New Beginning in Sobriety with AA.” \nThis special event will feature four speakers sharing their experience\, strength\, and hope\, along with a potluck BBQ and a drawing for prizes. Come enjoy an afternoon of connection and community! \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Saturday\, January 16\, 2027\nTime: 1:00 PM – 4:00 PM\nLocation: SCIF Meeting Hall\nAddress: 750 Mendocino Ave\, Suite 9\, Santa Rosa\, CA\nOnline Info:\n\nMeeting ID: 860 4370 3384\nPassword: 62\n\n\n\nWhat to Expect\n\nFour speakers sharing their recovery experiences\nPotluck BBQ\nDrawing for prizes\nFellowship with members of the local AA community\n\nWhether you’re new to recovery or have been part of the fellowship for years\, we hope you’ll join us as we celebrate the opportunity for new beginnings in sobriety.
URL:https://sonomacountyaa.org/event/seminar-a-new-beginning/
LOCATION:SCIF Meeting Hall\, 750 Mendocino Avenue\, Suite 9\, Santa Rosa\, CA\, 95401\, United States
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://sonomacountyaa.org/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/IMG_7218.jpg
END:VEVENT
